{"2828540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RollerGirl", "steam_appid": 2828540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Talk to your neighbours, get entangled in small-town shenanigans, navigate a teenage romance, and expose a local cover-up in this slice-of-life adventure. Your music and dialogue choices shape Naomi's summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naomi is 16 and finally gets to drive her first junker of a car... and it breaks down immediately. Desperate for cash to fix it, she laces up her rollerblades, grabs her MP3 player and does the unthinkable... she talks to her neighbours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do odd jobs around town, stumble into a romance, uncover a juicy town mystery and choose your vibe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the playlist and the world reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect music around town to grow your playlists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a curated, 2000s-inspired soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.poster.avif?t=1786038263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.webm?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.mp4?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROLLERBLADE ACROSS TOWN</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through open streets, discover shortcuts, and poke around people's backyards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/8f2e0d2891ffda22787d71e0e325d2aa.poster.avif?t=1786038263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/8f2e0d2891ffda22787d71e0e325d2aa.webm?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/8f2e0d2891ffda22787d71e0e325d2aa.mp4?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FORMATIVE ADVENTURE</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to fix your car by helping out your... interesting neighbours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run errands, recover lost items and meet your first crush.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/452dd27b192eac0e147d81c3eacd41da.poster.avif?t=1786038263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/452dd27b192eac0e147d81c3eacd41da.webm?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/452dd27b192eac0e147d81c3eacd41da.mp4?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of summer will you have?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Talk to your neighbours, get entangled in small-town shenanigans, navigate a teenage romance, and expose a local cover-up in this slice-of-life adventure. Your music and dialogue choices shape Naomi's summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naomi is 16 and finally gets to drive her first junker of a car... and it breaks down immediately. Desperate for cash to fix it, she laces up her rollerblades, grabs her MP3 player and does the unthinkable... she talks to her neighbours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do odd jobs around town, stumble into a romance, uncover a juicy town mystery and choose your vibe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the playlist and the world reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect music around town to grow your playlists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a curated, 2000s-inspired soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.poster.avif?t=1786038263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.webm?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.mp4?t=1786038263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROLLERBLADE ACROSS TOWN</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through open streets, discover shortcuts, and poke around people's backyards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_para